{
  "id": "2222",
  "title": "Ordering Food on the Plane",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2023-08-10",
  "synopsis": "Today, we will start our trip to Beijing with Amy! How will she communicate with the flight attendant on the plane?\r\nThis lesson features a common dialogue on flights. We will focus on learning how to order food on the plane and how to ask about the local time.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/2222/d5d1dea35e5860a324655d249c5762c51fb8038b.mp3?1690811635",
  "series": {
    "title": "Amy’s Trip to Beijing",
    "chapter": 0,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "飞机点餐\n\n乘务员：您好！您想喝点什么？我们有茶、咖啡、水和可乐。\n爱米：咖啡，谢谢！\n乘务员：您想要吃什么？牛肉饭还是鸡肉面？\n爱米：牛肉饭，谢谢！我可以要一杯水吗？\n乘务员：可以。给您。\n爱米：谢谢！我想问一下，我们到北京时，是当地时间几点呢？\n乘务员：我们会在北京时间晚上七点到北京。您要转机吗？\n爱米：不要。这是我第一次去北京。\n乘务员：希望您喜欢北京！",
    "traditional": "飛機點餐\n\n乘務員：您好！您想喝點什麼？我們有茶、咖啡、水和可樂。\n愛米：咖啡，謝謝！\n乘務員：您想要吃什麼？牛肉飯還是雞肉麵？\n愛米：牛肉飯，謝謝！我可以要一杯水嗎？\n乘務員：可以。給您。\n愛米：謝謝！我想問一下，我們到北京時，是當地時間幾點呢？\n乘務員：我們會在北京時間晚上七點到北京。您要轉機嗎？\n愛米：不要。這是我第一次去北京。\n乘務員：希望您喜歡北京！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ordering Food on the Plane"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "乘务员：您好！您想喝点什么？我们有茶、咖啡、水和可乐。",
      "traditional": "乘務員：您好！您想喝點什麼？我們有茶、咖啡、水和可樂。",
      "pinyin": "chéng wù yuán nín hǎo nín xiǎng hē diǎn shén me wǒ men yǒu chá kā fēi shuǐ hé kě lè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Flight attendant: Hello! What would you like to drink? We have tea, coffee, water, and cola."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "爱米：咖啡，谢谢！",
      "traditional": "愛米：咖啡，謝謝！",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ kā fēi xiè xie",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: Coffee, thank you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "乘务员：您想要吃什么？牛肉饭还是鸡肉面？",
      "traditional": "乘務員：您想要吃什麼？牛肉飯還是雞肉麵？",
      "pinyin": "chéng wù yuán nín xiǎng yào chī shén me niú ròu fàn hái shi jī ròu miàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Flight attendant: What would you like to eat? Beef rice or chicken noodles?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "爱米：牛肉饭，谢谢！我可以要一杯水吗？",
      "traditional": "愛米：牛肉飯，謝謝！我可以要一杯水嗎？",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ niú ròu fàn xiè xie wǒ kě yǐ yào yì bēi shuǐ ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: Beef rice, thank you! Can I have a cup of water?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "乘务员：可以。给您。",
      "traditional": "乘務員：可以。給您。",
      "pinyin": "chéng wù yuán kě yǐ gěi nín",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Flight attendant: You may. Here you go."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "爱米：谢谢！我想问一下，我们到北京时，是当地时间几点呢？",
      "traditional": "愛米：謝謝！我想問一下，我們到北京時，是當地時間幾點呢？",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ xiè xie wǒ xiǎng wèn yí xià wǒ men dào běi jīng shí shì dāng dì shí jiān jǐ diǎn ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: Thank you! May I ask, what’s the local time when we arrive in Beijing?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "乘务员：我们会在北京时间晚上七点到北京。您要转机吗？",
      "traditional": "乘務員：我們會在北京時間晚上七點到北京。您要轉機嗎？",
      "pinyin": "chéng wù yuán wǒ men huì zài běi jīng shí jiān wǎn shang qī diǎn dào běi jīng nín yào zhuǎn jī ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Flight Attendant: We will arrive in Beijing at 7 pm Beijing time. Are you transferring to another flight?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "爱米：不要。这是我第一次去北京。",
      "traditional": "愛米：不要。這是我第一次去北京。",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ bú yào zhè shì wǒ dì yī cì qù běi jīng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: No. This is my first visit to Beijing."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "乘务员：希望您喜欢北京！",
      "traditional": "乘務員：希望您喜歡北京！",
      "pinyin": "chéng wù yuán xī wàng nín xǐ huan běi jīng",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
