      "Ordering Food on the Plane",
      "",
      "Flight attendant: Hello! What would you like to drink? We have tea, coffee, water, and cola.",
      "",
      "Amy: Coffee, thank you!",
      "",
      "Flight attendant: What would you like to eat? Beef rice or chicken noodles?",
      "",
