      "",
      "Flight attendant: You may. Here you go.",
      "",
      "Amy: Thank you! May I ask, what’s the local time when we arrive in Beijing?",
      "",
      "Flight Attendant: We will arrive in Beijing at 7 pm Beijing time. Are you transferring to another flight?",
      "",
      "Amy: No. This is my first visit to Beijing.",
      "",
      "Flight attendant: Hope you enjoy Beijing!"
    ]
